    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.bufremove\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\n```txt\r\nE5108: Error executing lua: ...orkspace/git-repos/mini.bufremove/lua/mini/bufremove.lua:143: E\r\nrror executing lua: vim/_editor.lua:402: nvim_exec2(): Vim(bprevious):E85: There is no listed \r\nbuffer         \r\n```\r\n\r\n### Neovim version\r\n\r\nNVIM v0.10.0-dev-1904+g3bf887f6e-Homebrew\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nNo need.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.bufremove/blob/14805473144fffbd019d07e51bed2d176e065ee9/lua/mini/bufremove.lua#L157\r\n\r\nCan be easily fixed by using `pcall`.\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nharmless error should be suppressed.\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nharmless error was thrown.",
