            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, I can reproduce this when closing 'mini.starter' buffer right after opening Neovim. Not when closing buffer after opening Neovim without 'mini.starter', though.\r\n\r\nThis is a rather rare and unintended use case, but I'll see if adding `pcall()` here won't have side effects.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, using `pcall()` in the mapping for `wipeout()` can help here.",
